<title>JAPAN: Fuji Bank says to support Tobishima reconstruction.</title>
<headline>Fuji Bank says to support Tobishima reconstruction.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fuji Bank Ltd said on Friday it would give full support to debt-ridden Tobishima Corp's reconstruction plans.</p>
<p>Tobishima, a construction company, said last month that it had drawn up a new restructuring plan to try to solve its financial difficulties.</p>
<p>It said it would ask its creditors, including Fuji Bank, to reduce their claims against Tobishima for debts owed by its group companies from about 740 billion yen to 100 billion yen.</p>
</text>
